      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Crown Copyright © 2013. Published by Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Persistent idiopathic facial pain associated with mediastinal involvement in non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) may occur at presentation or at relapse. It is often under-recognised, leading to prolonged symptoms, distress and sometimes inappropriate interventions. We present three case histories and a review of the published literature to highlight this important symptom."
      },
